<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English soccer matches</p>
<p>on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Football League Cup third round replay</p>
<p> Oxford	 2	 Port Vale	   0</p>
<p>Oxford at home to Southampton or Lincoln in next round.</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Cardiff	2	 Rochdale	    1</p>
</text>
